---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About Us | SarkariPhotoResizer.com" description="Learn about SarkariPhotoResizer.com — our mission, on-device privacy guarantee, and commitment to helping Indian job aspirants.">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-12 space-y-8">
    <div class="text-center space-y-2">
      <span class="text-xs font-black text-blue-600 uppercase tracking-wider">About Our Platform</span>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-slate-900 tracking-tight">Built for Every Indian Job Aspirant</h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 max-w-xl mx-auto">
        Empowering students, job seekers, and cyber cafe operators with free, fast, and 100% private image resizing tools.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-10 shadow-sm border border-slate-200/80 prose prose-slate max-w-none text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed space-y-6">
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">Our Mission</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600">
          Every year in India, millions of aspiring youths apply for competitive examinations conducted by the Staff Selection Commission (SSC), Union Public Service Commission (UPSC), Railway Recruitment Boards (RRB), Institute of Banking Personnel Selection (IBPS), and State Police forces.
        </p>
        <p class="text-slate-600">
          Unfortunately, thousands of application forms get rejected at the scrutiny stage simply due to non-compliant photograph dimensions or incorrect signature file sizes (such as failing the strict 20 KB to 50 KB boundary). Complex desktop photo editing software like Adobe Photoshop is difficult to operate for ordinary applicants, and generic foreign compression websites often leave personal documents exposed to unknown cloud servers.
        </p>
        <p class="text-slate-600">
          <strong>SarkariPhotoResizer.com</strong> was created to eliminate this frustration once and for all: providing an instant, one-click online image tool that automatically locks photos and signatures to the exact technical dimensions and KB limits prescribed in official exam notifications.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3 border-t border-slate-100 pt-6">
        <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">Why Candidates &amp; Cyber Cafes Trust Us</h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 not-prose">
          <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-blue-50/60 border border-blue-100 space-y-1">
            <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm">🔒 100% Client-Side Privacy</h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-600">
              Unlike other tools, your passport photos and signatures are never uploaded to any remote server or database. Everything happens inside your browser's private memory.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-emerald-50/60 border border-emerald-100 space-y-1">
            <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm">⚡ 0.1s Zero-Wait Speed</h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-600">
              Instant in-browser Canvas compression ensures you never have to wait in a queue or download bloated desktop apps.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-amber-50/60 border border-amber-100 space-y-1">
            <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm">🎯 Exact Dimension &amp; KB Lock</h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-600">
              Pre-calibrated with official notification criteria for SSC, Railway, UPSC, Banking, and Police recruitment boards.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-purple-50/60 border border-purple-100 space-y-1">
            <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm">🆓 Completely Free Forever</h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-600">
              No registration, no hidden subscriptions, no mobile app installs, and zero watermarks on your downloaded images.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3 border-t border-slate-100 pt-6">
        <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">Independent Public Utility Notice</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600">
          SarkariPhotoResizer.com is an independent educational and document-utility platform. We are not affiliated with, endorsed by, or in any way officially connected with the Staff Selection Commission, Union Public Service Commission, Indian Railways, or any other government ministry or department. All official recruitment trademarks and names belong to their respective authorities.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
